        "title": "Unveiling cervical cancer therapeutics from Abrus precatorius and Aphanamixis polystachya: Insights from molecular docking, dynamics simulation, MM/GBSA and DFT analyses",
        "authorString": "Ahmed SS, Suchana L, Iʻjāz N, Rahman MO.",
